{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20050","headline":"大隐坊 赵记室俶在职无事 · 孟郊","name":"大隐坊 赵记室俶在职无事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卑静身後老，高动物先摧。\n方圆水任器，刚劲木成灰。\n大道母羣物，达人腹衆才。\n时吟尧舜篇，心向无爲开。\n彼隐山万曲，我隐酒一杯。\n公庭何所有，日日清风来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}